  "notes": "PARTIAL: The only official 2026 general-election document found on the county site is the Notice of Regular General Election (legal notice PDF). It lists township trustee/clerk candidates and the county hotel/motel tax measure, but the referenced published sample ballot (Centerville Ward 1) is not included in the PDF and no candidate list or sample ballots are posted, so Board of Supervisors, Treasurer, Recorder, Attorney, SWCD, Ag Extension and hospital trustee contests could not be collected. Supervisor district vs at-large status not determined from source. The notice states some townships have openings with no candidates; only township contests with named candidates are listed."
